  "description": "For centuries, human beings have been fascinated by dramatic stories of love, jealousy, and adventure. From ancient myths to modern soap operas, people just want to be entertained! But do you know the oldest myths of them all, those of Mesopotamia? Let Hongkki’s unique retelling guide you through an ancient world where the gods of nature still walk the land and timeless tales of destiny, love, and betrayal unfold. \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes prologue.*",
